Third-party components

@img/sharp-libvips-linux-x64 and the musl build (@img/sharp-libvips-linuxmusl-x64)
are LGPL-3.0-or-later. @img/sharp-wasm32 is Apache-2.0 AND LGPL-3.0-or-later
AND MIT. The sharp override in package.json pulls them in so
@xenova/transformers can run a local embedding model. They ship as separate
shared objects, not as AGPL-3.0 source. LGPL-3.0 stays compatible with
this AGPL-3.0-only program while those libraries remain separate and this
notice is kept. They are not AGPL-3.0.

Token vocabulary (src/indexer/o200k.json)

The file src/indexer/o200k.json holds the o200k_base token vocabulary packed
from the copy that the gpt-tokenizer package ships (https://github.com/niieani/gpt-tokenizer),
by scripts/tokenizer/gen-o200k.cjs. The license of that package is reproduced
below unchanged.

